Well, Spectre (the 'network' character's arch nemisis) can be hacked with
just about anything if you're patient.  I would use any artifact weapon
over a non-artifact I suppose.  An undocemented bug/feature is that Spectre 
doesn't like other copies of its self running at the same time, so if you 
rename your character to Spectre and start running, the Spectre quest nemisis 
will refuse to do anything while you are running.  You can just run up to 
him and hack.  Make sure you move/hack/move, or Spectre may start fighting
again.  Intrinsic speed is REAL useful for this trick.

